('Le Pacte du Mal (Ciné-Leçon)', 'le-pacte-du-mal', 'Sous la pression de sa famille, un homme s''engage dans une lutte mystique contre son collègue pour obtenir à tout prix une promotion. Un film chrétien qui livre une leçon de vie sur l''ambition.', NULL, 'Côte d''Ivoire', 'fr', 'ja5kYJcHlKI', 'https://img.youtube.com/vi/ja5kYJcHlKI/hqdefault.jpg', true, false),
('Marié par Prophétie — Épisode 14 (7SELAH)', 'marie-par-prophetie-ep14', 'Dans cet épisode 14, le doute change de camp : celui qui conseillait et pensait entendre Dieu remet lui-même en question ce qu''il croyait avoir reçu. Prophétie, discernement, responsabilité spirituelle, mariage chrétien et volonté de Dieu.', 2026, 'Cameroun', 'fr', 'sDle9yzvHrg', 'https://img.youtube.com/vi/sDle9yzvHrg/hqdefault.jpg', true, false),
('The Last Door (Fejosbaba TV)', 'the-last-door', 'Dara carries a vision she believes God gave her. She has prayed, fasted and prepared, yet one door refuses to open. A Christian drama about purpose, preparation, honour, persistence and divine timing, for anyone building a ministry, a business or a God-given assignment.', 2026, 'Nigeria', 'en', 'UZFMIF2Fa-o', 'https://img.youtube.com/vi/UZFMIF2Fa-o/hqdefault.jpg', true, false),
('Wealth in the Dream 3 (GACEM Films)', 'wealth-in-the-dream-3', 'Final part of the Wealth in the Dream series. The film reveals the hidden dangers and spiritual battles behind the pursuit of wealth through dreams and unseen forces, with lessons on ambition, destiny and the choices we make.', 2026, 'Nigeria', 'en', '49SNelgOT9k', 'https://img.youtube.com/vi/49SNelgOT9k/hqdefault.jpg', true, false),
('BUSY — Letter to the Church (God Said Media)', 'busy-letter-to-the-church', 'What happens when life gets so busy that we lose sight of God? A Christian film on how ministry, work, ambition, relationships and success can crowd out our spiritual priorities. Pastor Stanley is consumed with ministry, crusades and public criticism.', NULL, 'Nigeria', 'en', 'lnry1Ipw5Xk', 'https://img.youtube.com/vi/lnry1Ipw5Xk/hqdefault.jpg', true, false);
